    {
      "block_id": "p-3",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": "**Draft.** Explicit alpha limitations for Rig Relay.",
      "disclosure": {
        "level": "standard"
      }
    },
    {
      "block_id": "h2-4",
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 2,
      "content": "Deliberate Gaps",
      "disclosure": {
        "level": "standard",
        "initially_visible": true
      }
    },
    {
      "block_id": "p-5",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": "- Protected execution buttons remain absent - Bash, write, search, upload, spawn, fleet, and delegate controls remain locked - Full provider network checks are not implemented - Full local model downloads are not part of alpha - Production OAuth code exchange is not part of this slice - Telemetry upload remains opt-in and off by default - Local model benchmarking is a scaffold, not a released capability",
      "disclosure": {
        "level": "standard"
      }
    },
    {
      "block_id": "h2-6",
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 2,
      "content": "Product Constraints",
      "disclosure": {
        "level": "standard",
        "initially_visible": true
      }
    },
    {
      "block_id": "p-7",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": "- Textual remains a legacy fallback - Demo and release copy stay alpha-labeled - High-authority actions still require backend validation and receipts - The frontend remains a renderer, not a governor",
      "disclosure": {
        "level": "standard"
      }
    },
    {
      "block_id": "h2-8",
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 2,
      "content": "Data Constraints",
      "disclosure": {
        "level": "standard",
        "initially_visible": true
      }
    },
    {
      "block_id": "p-9",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": "- No raw prompts - No raw model outputs - No source code - No diffs - No stdout/stderr bodies - No tokens or secrets - No raw private paths in shareable artifacts",
      "disclosure": {
        "level": "standard"
      }
    }
  ],
